        {"zh": "叮当声中等待时机。", "en": "Waiting for the chance."},
        {"zh": "主人的食谱藏哪儿了？", "en": "Where are the recipes?"},
        {"zh": "叮当声中整理思绪。", "en": "Organizing thoughts while clanging."}
